<!-- ===== ABOUT ===== -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="container about">
    <div class="about-collage reveal">
      <div class="main-photo"><img src="/anh/img3.jpg" alt="Lalasea Beach Bar in the evening with string lights" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="sub-photo"><img src="/anh/img5.jpg" alt="Picnic lawn by the sea" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">The Lalasea story</span>
      <h2>"Lala" is a happy tune,<br>"sea" is the sea</h2>
      <p>Lalasea sits right at the edge of To Chau beach in Ha Tien. There are no walls — just shady trees, the sea breeze and the sound of waves behind your table.</p>
      <p>Dinner under string lights, a night in a wooden tent, sunrise right outside your tent — Lalasea hopes you'll stay for more than just a meal.</p>
      <p>The menu runs from seafood, snails and shellfish to grilled dishes, hotpot, beef, chicken and rice, so groups of friends and families looking for a good place to eat in Ha Tien can all find something they like, at easy prices.</p>
      <a href="#gallery" class="btn" style="margin-top:8px;">See the place 📸</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

